{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "4c9531151513b038c9648e2c974a797e9e100f34f669dcccf872df35a6d2e91a", "ja": "なんでやね～んっ！！\n……あっ、今のは手ごたえ、あったかも！", "zh": "搞什么呀！！\n……啊！刚才那个好像有抓到感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "0058e09ca5db7d38324cd8ac9ec976c6122b7816dec94152016a8d27c50595b6", "ja": "よ～し、もっともっと練習しようっと。\n目指せ、ツッコミマスター！なんて♪", "zh": "好～我再来多练习一下。\n目标是成为吐槽大师！开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1002_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "9cf7d48b22db312972fdf496fff62983acbbe4c4a774239205f726f0c49ee236", "ja": "なんでやねーんっ！！！", "zh": "搞什么呀！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0bb37e18a5ae4cde21bd23d227b2c9524c0f6c8f1c2838a2bb1dc39fdd2cbe40", "ja": "うわっ！？\n青羽さん、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "呜哇！？\n青羽小姐，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "770b91e0c131e93ac6a1fe46e00b4569a69326fe5075df3c394c7d6a3bf4af22", "ja": "え？　……ああっ！？　す、すみません、\n{$P$}さんにツッコんじゃいました！", "zh": "咦？……啊啊！？对、对不起，\n我对{$P$}先生吐槽了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "ec8274a02a76b92ec9c1d3e05f23d32b67dc104efa77191ff00e5d74c6b43707", "ja": "あの、今、ツッコミの練習をしていて……。", "zh": "那个，我刚刚在练习吐槽……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3504ab7a0302b52a0fd030a2941c8ee9a71e5ff0e6d58855b02fdf9569b268b2", "ja": "そうだったんですか。\n確かに、なかなか鋭いツッコミだったと思います。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n你刚才的吐槽确实很犀利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "2b0b9c5991a79876d755ec7ef189e1426aec8cdef2ad585bc5ff17b77bd0cf85", "ja": "えっ、そ、そうですか？　えへへ……♪", "zh": "咦！真、真的吗？嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "c2ed238b1dde3b698a00b50072af445cd5ff49f744dd2206d209084e8926cc6c", "ja": "あ！　そういえば社長さんが、\nお話があるって言ってましたよ！", "zh": "啊！对了，\n社长说他有事要找你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8adcaa0618952f0908d1dcc545d657696a2b96b61857296685da0712126f0b1c", "ja": "本当ですか？　ありがとうございます！\nさっそく事務所に行って、聞いてきます。", "zh": "是吗？谢谢！\n我这就去事务所问问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "08c7a2bb7680db8a3455b3e742a1cbbe5a4dc69018a16c6d88d9bdfbcdfe4699", "ja": "はーい、なんでやね～ん♪\n……じゃなかった！　い、行ってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好的～搞什么呀♪\n……不对！请、请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "22288d34fc0207e928c34d20855c256f93c81c336fdb88d5bbe8ceaba666995b", "ja": "ふむ……なるほど。\nこの実況動画というのは、なかなか面白いね！", "zh": "嗯……原来如此。\n这个直播影片真的很有趣呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "fdc6ab4db6f8b0fe6d963daec08256f60dbde314b3cc54470e758ae1ad6d2c6c", "ja": "やっぱり！　社長なら、わかってくれると思いました！\n他にも色々な動画があって……。", "zh": "我就知道社长一定会懂的！\n还有很多其他的影片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1015_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "491016c50abd5a88664010ee20c600c8d3e9e8e75ea9c53dbf78f40c5e3a7557", "ja": "おはようございます！\n……あれ？　社長、実況動画を見てるんですか？", "zh": "早安！\n……咦？社长你在看直播影片？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "338f9aff67ecf3e9da1b6d5638819f783032cf048d7f0fed97c54c13dd1a48e3", "ja": "うむ、音無君に教えてもらってね。\n私もこうして、若者文化を勉強しているんだよ。", "zh": "对啊，是拜托音无告诉我的，\n我也是会像这样学习年轻人文化喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "9e9f0122d930dd52fa77e93dc25839c6590d10cf10dc8b25399f69dfd4153a1d", "ja": "社長たる者、常に流行には敏感でいないとね！\n君も一緒にどうだい？　ほら、この動画とか……。", "zh": "身为社长，必须随时对流行保持敏锐度！\n你要不要也一起来看？像是这个影片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "7680088a9eee5f80811da0d6f6354002407c9a6ed13702adeece95c1b938554b", "ja": "社長、今日は{$P$}さんに\nお話があるんじゃなかったんですか？", "zh": "社长，你今天不是有事\n要找{$P$}先生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "36046518992aa92cb91324c759d682f68db190a573b97966512e16076101049a", "ja": "おっと、そうだった！　今日は君に、\n地方公演についての話をしようと思っていたのだよ。", "zh": "哎呀，差点就忘了！\n其实我今天是想找你谈一谈地方公演的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d3ed3f90b3a7f37d40a56c941e5465ff28c6781d4206c9397dfb259b7ed02ff2", "ja": "地方公演！\nもしかして、またやらせてもらえるんですか？", "zh": "地方公演！\n难道又能让我们表演了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "7dc5caa38efb4870782f4118c2089a39a9f68c73a446a782559e35bed49dd65d", "ja": "そのとおり！　前回の公演も大好評……\n地方公演は、今や劇場の新名物と言っていいだろう。", "zh": "没错！上次的公演也大受好评……\n可以说，地方公演现在已经是剧场的新名产了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "53dff416067a66969b93ae80a8eae8d9890895806402d50d2d34cf97d2cde578", "ja": "今回もまた、765プロのアイドル達の魅力を\n地方のファンに届けてきてほしい。頼めるかね？", "zh": "这次也希望你能将765艺能偶像们的魅力\n传达给各地的粉丝，可以麻烦你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_1024", "source_sha256": "6d680867148f971c559728309908257ffddd27a2d8916e6d48b720d05a8fc426", "ja": "頼まれました！", "zh": "被社长拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b263092a10e4aa8e47c67592a5fd65829078ad7e5c7f6ca0065f82157c1b5e73", "ja": "任せてください！　遠くのファンに会える事は、\nアイドル達にとってもいい経験ですから。", "zh": "请交给我吧！能见到远方的粉丝，\n对偶像们来说也是很棒的经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "a941fd9cf1fe0205c1b71fa039d91ceff8b73073c411f664b8a4c684e570f1a9", "ja": "おおっ、気合い十分のようだね！\nそれでは、よろしく頼むよ……っと、そうだ。", "zh": "哦哦！看来你干劲十足呢！\n那就麻烦你了……啊，对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "e2e2b6ab85ec505fec2bb42162f4df7ac862690b57c8982f625813098764dd15", "ja": "今回は、野々原茜君と伴田路子君を\nメインにと考えているんだが、どうだろう？", "zh": "这次我想主打野野原茜和伴田路子，\n你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "87d38089d2fa776004413d155046e0b82c2ad8188525be0e5805c1c3dec8e97e", "ja": "茜とロコ、個性的な組み合わせですね。\nどんなステージになるのか……。", "zh": "茜和ROCO……这个组合很有特色呢。\n不晓得会带来什么样的表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "28e1e9e43546e5f3404d91bdb35004a2b8b7d1aa27ab713a3a1ad7bc3ce179cb", "ja": "社長、今回も曲を用意してあるんですよね？", "zh": "社长，这次你也准备好新歌了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "de53ce32c4b03f6e1a5e9ff6c53d3eb88d4ee75530ea29592e022c7e2bf78a5f", "ja": "うむ！　実に可愛らしいラブソングだ。\n彼女達なら、歌いこなしてくれると信じているよ。", "zh": "嗯！是一首非常可爱的情歌。\n我相信她们两人会诠释得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2006_president", "source_sha256": "62887610b594c3e972cbeb70921c61824aee9b23934a8e1b59ae3edf17cc1257", "ja": "だが、今回の地方公演はそれだけではなく……\n君、更に上を目指してみないかね？", "zh": "不过，这次的地方公演不只有这样……\n你要不要往更高的目标迈进呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2007_p", "source_sha256": "95a84cc42f617031513bdce9ee3e7473e9123dac4527cefad2ad2efdff4b5cec", "ja": "更に上……と言いますと？", "zh": "更高的目标……社长是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2008_president", "source_sha256": "d6c63ef0696da819feb9e9cb7e22975020b43b96cc8d5e172ff81c366b607717", "ja": "より多くのファンを掴むために、\nプロモーションに力を入れてみようじゃないか！", "zh": "让我们大力宣传，\n抓住更多的粉丝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2009_p", "source_sha256": "e0efb8583fdd764f77d02b604b6eea73a589056f2c697b6158d46eba85e7ec43", "ja": "プロモーションですか……わかりました。\n考えてみます！", "zh": "宣传吗……我明白了。\n我会想想看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2010_president", "source_sha256": "7e9e26f16b742423d5b2ae89726231df9e26b257ab99587834e9a4d8bd924147", "ja": "うむ！　素晴らしいアイディアで、公演を\n最高に盛り上げてくれたまえ！　期待しているよ～！", "zh": "嗯！用你出色的点子将公演推到最高点吧！\n我很期待喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_intro_2011_p", "source_sha256": "ae808c2055be963578b1f38b4ddc2772fb2f98e16536d71f0db9e3749a3eb59d", "ja": "（地方公演のプロモーションか……。\n話題になるように、しっかり考えないとな！）", "zh": "（地方公演的宣传啊……\n我得好好思考如何让公演变成话题才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
